  "label": "User projected onto the child's confused reaction",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the bottom image of the child with the text 'you're welcome?' because the meme humorously implies that the user (or the audience) is the one who would be confused or shocked by the response 'you're welcome?' to a 'thank you'. The child's expression serves as a proxy for the user's potential reaction to the social norm violation.",
